helm: install charts from OCI repositories.
Artifact Hub lists a chart that is only in an OCI registry with an oci://
repository URL, such as oci://ghcr.io/naval-group/kubevirt-stack-charts/kubevirt.
The App Catalog adds that repository, then installs <repo>/<chart>. Adding it
failed with a 500, "failed to perform FetchReference on source: invalid
reference", because Headlamp downloaded every repository's index and an OCI
registry has none. Headlamp now records an oci:// repository without an index.
Install and upgrade pull <repo>/<chart> from it by the chart's oci://
reference, with a registry client that reads `helm registry login`
credentials. The chart list, which reads indexes, leaves such repositories out.

